  "context": {
    "explanation_en": "« -기가 무섭게 » is a vivid way of saying as soon as ~ / no sooner than ~. For example, « 종이 울리기가 무섭게 나갔어요 » (No sooner had the bell rung than they left).",
    "explanation_ko": "'-기가 무섭게'는 '~하자마자'를 생생하게 표현하는 방식입니다. 예: '종이 울리기가 무섭게 나갔어요'.",
    "key_expressions": [
      {
        "en": "No sooner had the bell rung than they left.",
        "ko": "종이 울리기가 무섭게 나갔어요."
      },
      {
        "en": "No sooner had I finished eating than I felt sleepy.",
        "ko": "밥을 먹기가 무섭게 졸렸어요."
      },
      {
        "en": "No sooner had he sat down than he fell asleep.",
        "ko": "그는 앉기가 무섭게 잠들었어요."
      }
    ]
  },
